and put in your suggestions as well.

00:10:04.858 --> 00:10:07.102
I'd love to know what did
you take from this video.

00:10:07.102 --> 00:10:09.024
What was the most important lesson

00:10:09.024 --> 00:10:11.061
that you learned that blew your mind

00:10:11.061 --> 00:10:13.462
that you're going to immediately apply

00:10:13.462 --> 00:10:15.455
to your life or your business somehow?

00:10:15.455 --> 00:10:17.039
Please leave it down
in the comments below,

00:10:17.039 --> 00:10:18.424
I'm super curious to find out.

00:10:18.424 --> 00:10:20.548
I also want to give a
quick shoutout Kat Harvey.

00:10:20.548 --> 00:10:22.833
Kat, thank you so much for
picking up a copy of my book,

00:10:22.833 --> 00:10:23.858
Your One Word,

00:10:23.858 --> 00:10:26.668
and the fun interview we did
together on your channel.

00:10:26.668 --> 00:10:28.997
It was a blast, I really
appreciate your support

00:10:28.997 --> 00:10:30.297
and I hope you're enjoying the read.

00:10:30.297 --> 00:10:31.965
- Today, we have a special guest

00:10:31.965 --> 00:10:34.008
who I admire and love.

00:10:34.008 --> 00:10:35.399
This guy has a huge heart.

00:10:35.399 --> 00:10:37.646
When you think of him,
I think of inspiration

00:10:37.646 --> 00:10:40.587
and definitely the money
'cause he's a boss, of course,

00:10:40.587 --> 00:10:43.727
and he's helping changing
lives all over the world.

00:10:43.727 --> 00:10:45.843
Just pouring into a lot of people.

00:10:45.843 --> 00:10:48.413
His videos on YouTube is
how I actually found him,

00:10:48.413 --> 00:10:50.577
so of course, I had to have him on today.

00:10:50.577 --> 00:10:51.520
So without further adieu,

00:10:51.520 --> 00:10:53.682
please welcome the mogul himself,

00:10:53.682 --> 00:10:54.937
Mister Evan Carmichael.

00:10:54.937 --> 00:10:56.784
- So thank you guys again for watching.

00:10:56.784 --> 00:10:58.143
I believe in you,

00:10:58.143 --> 00:11:00.148
I hope you continue to believe in yourself

00:11:00.148 --> 00:11:02.352
and whatever your one word is,

00:11:02.352 --> 00:11:03.779
much love.

00:11:03.779 --> 00:11:04.612
I'll see you soon.

00:11:04.612 --> 00:11:07.695
(jet engine soaring)

00:11:10.820 --> 00:11:12.265
- Once you know what your dream is,

00:11:12.265 --> 00:11:15.281
setting those goals to
accomplish that dream.

00:11:15.281 --> 00:11:17.564
It will require a sacrifice,

00:11:17.564 --> 00:11:19.644
it will require work,

00:11:19.644 --> 00:11:22.797
it will require maybe sleepless nights,

00:11:22.797 --> 00:11:25.359
but your passion for what your dream is

00:11:25.359 --> 00:11:26.828
has to be that strong that you're willing

00:11:26.828 --> 00:11:29.682
to sacrifice all that to accomplish it.

00:11:29.682 --> 00:11:30.940
Put good people around you

00:11:30.940 --> 00:11:33.101
that can help you get to
where you're trying to go,

00:11:33.101 --> 00:11:35.149
move you in the right direction.

00:11:35.149 --> 00:11:37.063
Don't get caught up in
a crazy relationship

00:11:37.063 --> 00:11:39.511
in college unless you went
to college to get married,

00:11:39.511 --> 00:11:40.688
which some do.

00:11:40.688 --> 00:11:43.135
In that case, find a good man

00:11:43.135 --> 00:11:44.884
and do it quick (chuckles)

00:11:44.884 --> 00:11:47.210
before somebody else does.

00:11:47.210 --> 00:11:49.668
Other than that, stay
focused on your education.

00:11:49.668 --> 00:11:50.571
Focus in important,

00:11:50.571 --> 00:11:51.916
don't get caught up going here

00:11:51.916 --> 00:11:53.219
and there and everywhere.

00:11:53.219 --> 00:11:55.177
Just keep your eyes on the prize,

00:11:55.177 --> 00:11:58.026
keep God in your life and you'll be there.

